# Nexora Platform UX Constitution

Canonical reference: `docs/06-guidelines/NEXORA_PLATFORM_UX_CONSTITUTION.md`.

This rule applies to **every** Business App: HR, Payroll, Finance, Inventory, Sales, CRM, Purchasing, Manufacturing, Maintenance, Fleet, Projects, Help Desk, POS, Commerce, Quality, Documents, Assets, Analytics, and all future modules.

**Do not redesign a single page to satisfy this rule.** Define and reuse platform UX architecture.

## Constitutional Principles

- Apps consume the official UX foundation — no competing shells, tables, forms, feedback, or edit modes.
- Lookup-first: `EntityLookup` for all relations; never raw UUID fields.
- List-first workspaces: create/edit as modals (`RecordFormDialog` + `?create=` / `?edit=`).
- Profile/detail: Edit Mode v2 (`EditablePage`, `EditableProfileWorkspace`) — saving never navigates away.
- Cross-engine fields: in-page workflow dialog — never direct DB updates or `router.push`.
- Feedback: `platform.feedback` only — never Sonner directly.
- Dates: `DatePicker` / `DatePickerField` — never `<input type="date">`.
- Easy operator forms: `FieldGroup` labels, max 3 cols, create before filter, full i18n — see [Easy Operator Forms Standard](../../docs/06-guidelines/EASY_OPERATOR_FORMS_STANDARD.md) and `easy-operator-forms.mdc`.
- Permissions: visible read-only with lock icon when denied; enforce server-side + RLS.

## Required Platform Components

From `@/shared/ui`:

| Concern | Components |
| --- | --- |
| Page layout | `PageContainer`, `PageHeader`, `PageContent`, `PageFilters`, `PageActions` |
| Lists | `ListPageTemplate`, `EnterpriseDataTable`, `FacetedFilterBar`, `ImportExportActions` |
| Modals | `RecordFormDialog`, `RecordFormSection`, modal query helpers |
| Form fields | `FieldGroup`, `FormSection`, `FormGrid` |
| Profiles | `EditableProfileWorkspace`, `EditablePage`, `EditableSectionCard`, `EditableFieldGrid`, `EditableField` |
| Cross-engine | `CrossEngineLookupWorkflow`, `renderWorkflow` on `EditablePage` |
| Documents | `DocumentLayout`, `DocumentLifecycleBar` |
| Dashboards | `DashboardTemplate`, KPI widgets |
| Lookup / dates | `EntityLookup`, `DatePicker`, `DatePickerField` |
| States | Skeleton loaders, empty states, error surfaces via shared patterns |
| Tokens | `src/shared/ui/tokens/` + `globals.css` — no hardcoded colors/spacing |

## Universal Profile Architecture

Every entity profile (Employee, Customer, Supplier, Item, Warehouse, Asset, Machine, Vehicle, Project, Company, Branch, Contract, Document) uses:

```text
Header → Edit Mode bar → NavTabBar → EditableSectionCard sections → optional FloatingRecordPanel
```

Standard tabs: Overview, Details, Relations, Timeline, Documents, Comments, Audit.

## Universal List Architecture

Every list shares: search, saved views, filters, grouping, columns, density, selection, pagination, row/bulk/inline actions, export/import, empty/loading/error states, modal create/edit.

## Interaction Rules

| Input | Behavior |
| --- | --- |
| Single click | Select / activate |
| Double click | Open detail or profile |
| Right click | Context menu (safe actions) |
| `Ctrl/Cmd + K` | Command palette |
| `Ctrl/Cmd + S` | Save Changes (Edit Mode) |
| `Esc` | Close overlay / cancel edit |

**Autosave:** notes, descriptions, comments only.  
**Never autosave:** financial, assignment, contract, payroll, inventory values.

## Autosave / Save / Audit

- Manual batch save in Edit Mode v2.
- Undo/redo applies to draft only.
- Business-critical saves record audit: who, when, old value, new value, reason.
- Section-level refresh only — never full page reload.

## Surface Selection

| Use | Surface |
| --- | --- |
| Create/edit master record | `RecordFormDialog` modal over list |
| Confirmations / warnings | `Dialog` |
| Side detail / quick review | Drawer / `FloatingRecordPanel` |
| Mobile nav / filters | `Sheet` |
| Long operational process | `OxWizardDefinition` wizard |
| Transaction document | Document Workspace + lifecycle bar |

## Design Tokens

Use `globals.css` and `src/shared/ui/tokens/`. 8px spacing, subtle shadows, Lucide icons, module accent as decoration only (90% neutral UI). Verify dark mode and RTL.

## Quality Gate

Before merge, every screen must have: shared components, list/profile/document pattern, loading/empty/error states, dark mode, RTL, keyboard access, no raw IDs, server permissions, platform feedback.

